# Frontend

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md`. This surface is **Operate**.
2. Load craft-floor before editing UI. No timid default dashboards.
3. View vs edit must be obvious. Default view. Edit does not look like view with extra buttons only.
4. Agent state is first-class: running, waiting for approval, done — not a hidden chat log.
5. Charts are the navigation. Click-to-filter and drill must feel native.
6. Verify in the browser: view, edit, drill, query, approval. Appearance-only checks are not enough.
